    title: "Indy 500",
    description: Some("Steer with a knob and hold the button to accelerate. Race an opponent twenty-five laps around the Grand Prix or Devil\'s Elbow circuits, or the Ice Sprint and Ice Rally tracks where the surface fights your steering. Crash \'n Score inverts the goal — ram the white square, which reappears elsewhere each time you hit it. In Tag, the blinking car is \"it\" and you score for every second you stay untagged."),
